{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/03/14/2155286/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"グアムのホテルはさゆまっちょと一緒だったよ〜ヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"上の写真はホテルの部屋からの夕景"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/03/14/2155286/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"風が強すぎて、ベランダに洗って干したUVカットのパーカーが飛んでどこかに行きました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もしグアムに行く機会があって、もし見つけた方ご一報ください。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"黒のUVパーカーです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/03/14/2155286/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日本食レストランの店員さんが見せてくれたヤシガニちゃん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/03/14/2155286/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/03/14/2155286/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うーむ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごくバカンス野郎って感じ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/03/14/2155286/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりかに撮ってもらったヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他にもまりカメラマンにいろいろ撮ってもらったよ(^-^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつかまりカメラマンと仲間たちで作品出したいね(^-^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近いろいろお騒がせしてしまってすみません(´；ω；｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は変わらず元気ですヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからもいっぱい笑顔でお仕事頑張ります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へばなっ☆彡"}],"source":"archive"}